CoingeckoTest
└── fetchFromCoinGecko
    ├── given a successful response
    │   ├── it converts fiat-per-ZEC to ZEC-per-fiat
    │   ├── it upper-cases the currency codes
    │   └── it names itself as the source
    ├── given a price that is not usable
    │   └── it filters zero/negative/non-numeric prices
    ├── given ZEC data is missing
    │   └── it throws
    └── given an HTTP error
        └── it throws
